  <h2>Compare quotations on the same basis</h2>
  <p>A price per case is not enough to compare two manga drinks wholesalers. Ask for the exact reference, unit count, container volume, packaging and transport costs. An apparently cheaper selection may tie up more cash if the quantities exceed your sales capacity. Also compare the information needed to list the product: images, composition, allergens, batch identification and durability dates. Assess an order you can actually manage in your store, rather than a single price line.</p>
